User Data, and may authorize an Authorized Data Recipient to do so on the
Licensee's behalf. (c) Carve-Out. This §5 grants no right to copy,
distribute, modify, reverse engineer, or continue using the Software beyond the
rights expressly granted in §3. The Licensor's obligations under this §5
survive expiration or termination to the extent necessary to effect the data
