§5.1 -- Maintain User Autonomy
Notwithstanding the restrictions on the Software above, nothing in this License
restricts the Licensee's rights in their own User Data. This License is not used
to condition access to User Data on waiving any right, nor to prevent the
Licensee from independently exercising rights in that data.

§5.2 -- Provide User Data
Where the Licensor operates an instance processing the Licensee's User Data, the
Licensor provides the Licensee a reasonable means to obtain a complete copy of
that User Data in a documented, interoperable format, without undue delay.

§5.3 -- No Withholding User Data
The Licensor does not withhold the Licensee's User Data as leverage to force
acceptance of additional terms, fees, or technical restrictions that limit
