§5.4 -- No Data Lock-in
The Licensor does not impose technical measures or legal terms that prevent the
Licensee from migrating their User Data to another operator or a self-hosted
instance.

§6.1 -- Confidentiality
The Software and any non-public information disclosed with it are the Licensor's
